Answer: we already have it. arc_solver_kit.OfflineSolver (via arc_loop_solve.py)
imports the environment_files sims offline, set_level-teleports, deepcopy/replay-
from-reset clone-branches, and reads frame.levels_completed -- the leaders' exact
